WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:08.792
Cora was looking at her rock garden.

2
00:00:08.793 --> 00:00:12.466
Mo and Mandy swam over.

3
00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:16.487
"What happened to your rock garden?" Mo asked.

4
00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:26.716
Cora sighed. "A wave washed some rocks away."

5
00:00:26.717 --> 00:00:30.769
"I'll get some new rocks," Mandy said.

6
00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:33.930
"I know where to find pretty ones."

7
00:00:33.931 --> 00:00:39.703
"Great!" Cora said. "Thanks!"

8
00:00:39.704 --> 00:00:45.676
The dolphin took off.

9
00:00:45.677 --> 00:00:51.066
But soon Mandy was back.

10
00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:55.896
She was swimming oddly.

11
00:00:55.897 --> 00:01:00.007
"What's wrong, Mandy?" Cora asked.

12
00:01:00.008 --> 00:01:05.459
"It's my fin," Mandy said. "It really hurts."

13
00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.699
Cora and Mo swam closer.

14
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.338
"Oh boy," Mo said.

15
00:01:11.339 --> 00:01:14.262
"There's a fishing hook in your fin."

16
00:01:14.263 --> 00:01:19.196
Mandy moaned. "Ouch!"

17
00:01:19.197 --> 00:01:22.165
"I'll remove it!" Cora said.

18
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:24.795
Cora reached out her tentacles.

19
00:01:24.796 --> 00:01:27.980
She pulled gently on the hook.

20
00:01:27.981 --> 00:01:31.305
But the hook was in too deep!

21
00:01:31.306 --> 00:01:34.748
"What should we do?" Mo asked.

22
00:01:34.749 --> 00:01:41.981
Mandy sniffed. "Cora," she said.

23
00:01:41.982 --> 00:01:45.102
"Could your compass help?"

24
00:01:45.103 --> 00:01:48.930
Mo shrugged. "Maybe.

25
00:01:48.931 --> 00:01:54.874
But it usually helps when there's danger."

26
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:58.170
Cora looked at the fishing hook.

27
00:01:58.171 --> 00:02:03.549
She looked at Mandy's tears.

28
00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:07.154
"Let's try the compass," Cora said.

29
00:02:07.155 --> 00:02:09.214
"We'll see what happens.

30
00:02:09.215 --> 00:02:15.931
Follow me!"

31
00:02:15.932 --> 00:02:20.953
The three friends swam to the cave.

